  unitName: Stormwing
  unitId: 850124
  unitNumber: 8067
  description: Stormwings are augmented aero machines infused with the extracted
    souls of Harpies. They were one of the first experimental creations by Gazia
    in the light of the Augmentation Wars which eventually caused the fall of Athensphere.
    Their sharp claws and mechanical bodies allow these highly intelligent souls
    to take more damage and punishment than their original bodies. They can reach
    hazardous areas or pursue enemies at unmatched speeds, making them a highly lethal
    opponent on the battlefield.
